.SH NAME
dish \- DIrectory SHell
.SH SYNOPSIS
.in +.5i
.ti -.5i
.B dish
\%[\-call\0name-or-address]
.in -.5i
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The \fIdish\fR program provides a textual interface to the X.500 OSI Directory.
It gives full access to all elements of the DAP protocol.
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fIThe ISO Development Environment: User's Manual, Volume 5: QUIPU\fR
.br
ISO 9594:
\fIInformation Processing \-\- Open Systems Interconnection \-\-
The Directory
.SH AUTHOR
Colin Robbins, UCL
